---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Eran Gamage — Data Science & AI Systems"
  description="Eran Gamage is a physics-trained data science researcher working on practical AI systems, retrieval, energy analytics, and privacy-preserving data access."
>
  <section class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-[1.25fr_0.75fr] md:items-center">
    <div class="space-y-8">
      <p class="eyebrow">Physics · Data Science · Practical AI</p>

      <div class="space-y-5">
        <h1 class="max-w-3xl text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white md:text-6xl">
          Data science work with a research mindset.
        </h1>
        <p class="max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-300">
          I’m Eran Gamage, a physics-trained data science researcher building practical AI systems for retrieval, energy analytics, and privacy-aware data access.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/projects">View projects</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/contact">Contact</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <aside class="card subtle-card">
      <p class="eyebrow">Current focus</p>
      <ul class="mt-5 space-y-4 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-300">
        <li>
          <span class="font-medium text-white">Retrieval systems</span><br />
          RAG workflows, evaluation, and grounded answers.
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="font-medium text-white">Energy analytics</span><br />
          Forecasting and analysis using Australian grid data.
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="font-medium text-white">Private retrieval</span><br />
          UBT, PIR, and privacy-preserving protocol ideas.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </aside>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-16 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3">
    <article class="card">
      <p class="eyebrow">01</p>
      <h2 class="mt-4 text-xl font-semibold text-white">Build carefully</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-300">
        I prefer small, reproducible systems with clear assumptions and measurable behavior.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <p class="eyebrow">02</p>
      <h2 class="mt-4 text-xl font-semibold text-white">Evaluate honestly</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-300">
        Strong baselines, time-aware validation, and readable results matter more than flashy claims.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <p class="eyebrow">03</p>
      <h2 class="mt-4 text-xl font-semibold text-white">Keep learning</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-300">
        My work sits between applied machine learning, data engineering, and research questions I find useful.
      </p>
    </article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
